<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <meta name="description" content="Okane Flow - Prévision de trésorerie simple, visuelle et dynamique." />
  <title>Okane Flow</title>
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#14241f" />
  <meta name="mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes" />
  <meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes" />
  <meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-status-bar-style" content="black-translucent" />
  <meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-title" content="Okane Flow" />
  <link rel="manifest" href="./manifest.webmanifest" />
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="192x192" href="./icons/icon-192.png" />
  <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="./icons/icon-192.png" />

  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net" />
  <style>
:root {
  --bg: #f4f6f8;
  --surface: #ffffff;
  --surface-soft: #f8fafb;
  --text: #17212b;
  --muted: #6d7a86;
  --line: #e4e9ee;
  --primary: #1d5b4f;
  --primary-dark: #15463d;
  --primary-soft: #e9f3f0;
  --success: #1f8a5b;
  --success-soft: #e9f7f0;
  --danger: #c84747;
  --danger-soft: #fff0f0;
  --warning: #b97816;
  --warning-soft: #fff6e7;
  --shadow: 0 16px 40px rgba(23, 33, 43, 0.07);
  --radius: 18px;
  --radius-sm: 12px;
}

* {
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

html {
  scroll-behavior: smooth;
}

body {
  margin: 0;
  font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
  background: var(--bg);
  color: var(--text);
}

button,
input,
select,
textarea {
  font: inherit;
}

button {
  cursor: pointer;
}

.app-shell {
  min-height: 100vh;
}

.sidebar {
  position: fixed;
  inset: 0 auto 0 0;
  width: 260px;
  background: #14241f;
  color: #fff;
  padding: 24px 18px;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  z-index: 30;
  transition: transform 0.25s ease;
}

.brand {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 12px;
  padding: 4px 6px 28px;
}

.brand-mark {
  width: 42px;
  height: 42px;
  border-radius: 13px;
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  font-weight: 800;
  color: #173a31;
  background: #f1d58a;
}

.brand h1,
.brand p {
  margin: 0;
}

.brand h1 {
  font-size: 18px;
}

.brand p {
  margin-top: 3px;
  font-size: 12px;
  color: #9fb4ad;
}

.nav-list {
  display: grid;
  gap: 8px;
}

.nav-item {
  border: 0;
  background: transparent;
  color: #afc0bb;
  padding: 13px 14px;
  border-radius: 12px;
  text-align: left;
  display: flex;
  gap: 12px;
  align-items: center;
  transition: 0.2s ease;
}

.nav-item:hover,
.nav-item.active {
  color: #fff;
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
}

.nav-item.active {
  box-shadow: inset 3px 0 0 #f1d58a;
}

.sidebar-footer {
  margin-top: auto;
}

.status-chip {
  font-size: 12px;
  color: #9fb4ad;
  display: flex;
  gap: 8px;
  align-items: center;
  padding: 12px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  border-radius: 12px;
}

.status-dot {
  width: 8px;
  height: 8px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: #7fd0aa;
}

.main-content {
  margin-left: 260px;
  padding: 0 32px 48px;
}

.topbar {
  min-height: 96px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 20px;
}

.topbar-left {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 12px;
}

.topbar h2,
.topbar p {
  margin: 0;
}

.topbar h2 {
  font-size: 28px;
}

.topbar-actions {
  display: flex;
  gap: 10px;
}

.eyebrow {
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.11em;
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 800;
  color: var(--muted);
  margin: 0 0 6px;
}

.button {
  border: 0;
  border-radius: 11px;
  padding: 11px 16px;
  font-weight: 750;
  transition: transform 0.15s ease, opacity 0.15s ease, background 0.15s ease;
}

.button:hover {
  transform: translateY(-1px);
}

.button-primary {
  background: var(--primary);
  color: #fff;
}

.button-primary:hover {
  background: var(--primary-dark);
}

.button-secondary {
  color: var(--text);
  background: var(--surface);
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
}

.button-danger {
  color: #fff;
  background: var(--danger);
}

.full-width {
  width: 100%;
}

.icon-button {
  width: 40px;
  height: 40px;
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  background: var(--surface);
  border-radius: 11px;
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  color: var(--text);
  font-size: 20px;
}

.mobile-only {
  display: none;
}

.view {
  display: none;
}

.view.active {
  display: block;
}

.hero-card {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #163f35, #1c5b4d);
  color: #fff;
  padding: 28px;
  border-radius: 22px;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow);
}

.hero-card .eyebrow {
  color: #b8d8ce;
}

.hero-card h3 {
  margin: 0;
  font-size: clamp(32px, 4vw, 48px);
}

.hero-card p:last-child {
  margin: 8px 0 0;
  color: #cce0da;
}

.compact-field {
  min-width: 150px;
}

.compact-field span {
  color: #d7e6e1;
}

.metrics-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
  gap: 16px;
  margin: 18px 0;
}

.metric-card,
.panel {
  background: var(--surface);
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  box-shadow: var(--shadow);
}

.metric-card {
  padding: 18px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
  gap: 14px;
}

.metric-card p,
.metric-card small,
.metric-card strong {
  display: block;
}

.metric-card p {
  color: var(--muted);
  margin: 0 0 8px;
  font-size: 13px;
}

.metric-card strong {
  font-size: 21px;
  margin-bottom: 5px;
}

.metric-card small {
  color: #8a96a0;
  font-size: 11px;
}

.metric-icon {
  width: 42px;
  height: 42px;
  border-radius: 12px;
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  font-weight: 900;
  flex: 0 0 auto;
}

.metric-icon.income,
.metric-icon.positive {
  background: var(--success-soft);
  color: var(--success);
}

.metric-icon.negative {
  background: var(--danger-soft);
  color: var(--danger);
}

.metric-icon.balance {
  background: var(--primary-soft);
  color: var(--primary);
}

.dashboard-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.65fr) minmax(290px, 0.85fr);
  gap: 18px;
  margin-bottom: 18px;
}

.bottom-grid {
  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
}

.panel {
  padding: 20px;
}

.panel-header {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 18px;
  margin-bottom: 18px;
}

.panel-header h3,
.panel-header p {
  margin: 0;
}

.panel-header h3 {
  font-size: 18px;
}

.chart-wrap {
  position: relative;
  min-height: 360px;
}

.chart-wrap canvas {
  width: 100% !important;
  height: 360px !important;
}

.legend {
  display: flex;
  gap: 14px;
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 12px;
}

.legend i {
  display: inline-block;
  width: 18px;
  height: 3px;
  border-radius: 99px;
  margin-right: 5px;
  vertical-align: middle;
}

.legend-line {
  background: var(--primary);
}

.legend-risk {
  background: var(--danger);
}

.empty-state {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  display: none;
  place-items: center;
  align-content: center;
  text-align: center;
  color: var(--muted);
  padding: 24px;
}

.empty-state.show {
  display: grid;
}

.empty-state.compact {
  position: static;
  min-height: 240px;
}

.empty-icon {
  width: 52px;
  height: 52px;
  border-radius: 16px;
  background: var(--surface-soft);
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  font-size: 24px;
  margin-bottom: 10px;
}

.empty-state h4,
.empty-state p {
  margin: 0;
}

.empty-state p {
  margin-top: 6px;
  max-width: 420px;
  font-size: 13px;
}

.risk-badge,
.count-badge {
  padding: 7px 10px;
  border-radius: 999px;
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: 800;
  background: var(--surface-soft);
  color: var(--muted);
}

.risk-badge.safe {
  background: var(--success-soft);
  color: var(--success);
}

.risk-badge.warning {
  background: var(--warning-soft);
  color: var(--warning);
}

.risk-badge.danger {
  background: var(--danger-soft);
  color: var(--danger);
}

.risk-summary {
  display: flex;
  gap: 14px;
  align-items: flex-start;
  padding: 15px;
  background: var(--surface-soft);
  border-radius: 14px;
}

.risk-summary strong,
.risk-summary p {
  display: block;
  margin: 0;
}

.risk-summary p {
  color: var(--muted);
  margin-top: 5px;
  font-size: 13px;
}

.risk-visual {
  width: 42px;
  height: 42px;
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  border-radius: 12px;
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  font-weight: 900;
}

.risk-visual.safe {
  background: var(--success-soft);
  color: var(--success);
}

.risk-visual.warning {
  background: var(--warning-soft);
  color: var(--warning);
}

.risk-visual.danger {
  background: var(--danger-soft);
  color: var(--danger);
}

.risk-details {
  display: grid;
  gap: 10px;
  margin-top: 12px;
}

.risk-detail {
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  padding: 10px 0;
}

.risk-detail:last-child {
  border-bottom: 0;
}

.risk-detail strong,
.risk-detail span {
  display: block;
}

.risk-detail span {
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 12px;
  margin-top: 4px;
}

.event-list {
  display: grid;
}

.event-row {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: auto 1fr auto;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 12px;
  padding: 13px 0;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
}

.event-row:last-child {
  border-bottom: 0;
}

.event-type-dot {
  width: 38px;
  height: 38px;
  border-radius: 11px;
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  font-weight: 900;
}

.event-type-dot.income {
  background: var(--success-soft);
  color: var(--success);
}

.event-type-dot.expense {
  background: var(--danger-soft);
  color: var(--danger);
}

.event-row h4,
.event-row p,
.event-row strong {
  margin: 0;
}

.event-row h4 {
  font-size: 14px;
}

.event-row p {
  font-size: 12px;
  color: var(--muted);
  margin-top: 4px;
}

.event-row strong {
  font-size: 14px;
}

.category-list {
  display: grid;
  gap: 13px;
}

.category-item {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
  gap: 8px 14px;
}

.category-item p,
.category-item strong {
  margin: 0;
  font-size: 13px;
}

.category-item p {
  color: var(--muted);
}

.progress {
  grid-column: 1 / -1;
  height: 7px;
  background: var(--surface-soft);
  border-radius: 99px;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.progress span {
  display: block;
  height: 100%;
  border-radius: inherit;
  background: var(--primary);
}

.section-toolbar {
  margin-bottom: 16px;
}

.filters-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: minmax(240px, 1fr) 220px 220px;
  gap: 12px;
}

.field {
  display: grid;
  gap: 7px;
}

.field > span {
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: 750;
  color: var(--muted);
}

.field input,
.field select,
.field textarea {
  width: 100%;
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius: 11px;
  background: var(--surface);
  color: var(--text);
  padding: 11px 12px;
  outline: none;
}

.field input:focus,
.field select:focus,
.field textarea:focus {
  border-color: #8db4aa;
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(29, 91, 79, 0.1);
}

.field small {
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 11px;
}

.input-with-suffix {
  position: relative;
}

.input-with-suffix input {
  padding-right: 52px;
}

.input-with-suffix span {
  position: absolute;
  right: 13px;
  top: 50%;
  transform: translateY(-50%);
  color: var(--muted);
  font-weight: 700;
}

.table-wrap {
  overflow-x: auto;
}

table {
  width: 100%;
  border-collapse: collapse;
  min-width: 900px;
}

th,
td {
  text-align: left;
  padding: 14px 10px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  vertical-align: middle;
}

th {
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 11px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.07em;
}

td {
  font-size: 13px;
}

.align-right {
  text-align: right;
}

.table-title strong,
.table-title span {
  display: block;
}

.table-title span {
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 11px;
  margin-top: 3px;
}

.amount-income {
  color: var(--success);
  font-weight: 800;
}

.amount-expense {
  color: var(--danger);
  font-weight: 800;
}

.pill {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 5px;
  padding: 6px 9px;
  border-radius: 999px;
  background: var(--surface-soft);
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 750;
}

.pill.income {
  background: var(--success-soft);
  color: var(--success);
}

.pill.expense {
  background: var(--danger-soft);
  color: var(--danger);
}

.row-actions {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: flex-end;
  gap: 5px;
}

.mini-button {
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  background: var(--surface);
  border-radius: 9px;
  padding: 7px 9px;
}

.mini-button.danger {
  color: var(--danger);
}

.text-button {
  border: 0;
  background: transparent;
  color: var(--primary);
  font-weight: 800;
}

.calendar-header {
  align-items: flex-end;
}

.calendar-controls {
  display: flex;
  gap: 8px;
}

.calendar-weekdays,
.calendar-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(7, minmax(0, 1fr));
}

.calendar-weekdays {
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 11px;
  text-align: center;
  font-weight: 800;
  margin-bottom: 8px;
}

.calendar-day {
  min-height: 124px;
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  padding: 10px;
  background: #fff;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.calendar-day:nth-child(n + 8) {
  border-top: 0;
}

.calendar-day:not(:nth-child(7n + 1)) {
  border-left: 0;
}

.calendar-day.muted {
  background: var(--surface-soft);
  color: #a8b0b7;
}

.calendar-day.today {
  box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 2px var(--primary);
}

.calendar-day-number {
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: 800;
  margin-bottom: 8px;
}

.calendar-event {
  border-radius: 7px;
  padding: 5px 6px;
  margin-bottom: 5px;
  font-size: 10px;
  white-space: nowrap;
  overflow: hidden;
  text-overflow: ellipsis;
}

.calendar-event.income {
  background: var(--success-soft);
  color: var(--success);
}

.calendar-event.expense {
  background: var(--danger-soft);
  color: var(--danger);
}

.settings-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
  gap: 18px;
}

.settings-grid .info-panel {
  grid-column: 1 / -1;
}

.form-stack {
  display: grid;
  gap: 15px;
}

.file-button {
  display: inline-flex;
  justify-content: center;
}

.info-panel p {
  color: var(--muted);
  line-height: 1.65;
}

.feature-list {
  padding-left: 20px;
  line-height: 1.9;
}

.modal-backdrop {
  position: fixed;
  inset: 0;
  background: rgba(9, 17, 14, 0.58);
  display: none;
  place-items: center;
  padding: 18px;
  z-index: 100;
}

.modal-backdrop.open {
  display: grid;
}

.modal {
  width: min(760px, 100%);
  max-height: 92vh;
  overflow-y: auto;
  background: var(--surface);
  border-radius: 20px;
  box-shadow: 0 26px 80px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.28);
}

.modal-header,
.modal-footer {
  padding: 20px 22px;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 12px;
}

.modal-header {
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
}

.modal-header h3,
.modal-header p {
  margin: 0;
}

.modal-body {
  padding: 22px;
}

.modal-footer {
  padding: 20px 0 0;
  justify-content: flex-end;
}

.segmented-control {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
  background: var(--surface-soft);
  border-radius: 12px;
  padding: 4px;
  margin-bottom: 18px;
}

.segmented-control input {
  position: absolute;
  opacity: 0;
}

.segmented-control span {
  display: block;
  text-align: center;
  padding: 10px;
  border-radius: 9px;
  color: var(--muted);
  font-weight: 800;
  cursor: pointer;
}

.segmented-control input:checked + span {
  color: #fff;
  background: var(--primary);
}

.form-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
  gap: 15px;
}

.full-span {
  grid-column: 1 / -1;
}

.toast-container {
  position: fixed;
  right: 18px;
  bottom: 18px;
  z-index: 200;
  display: grid;
  gap: 10px;
}

.toast {
  min-width: 280px;
  max-width: 380px;
  background: #15221e;
  color: #fff;
  border-radius: 12px;
  padding: 13px 15px;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow);
  animation: slideIn 0.2s ease;
}

.toast.error {
  background: #7f2f2f;
}

@keyframes slideIn {
  from { transform: translateY(8px); opacity: 0; }
  to { transform: translateY(0); opacity: 1; }
}

@media (max-width: 1100px) {
  .metrics-grid {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
  }

  .dashboard-grid,
  .bottom-grid {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }
}

@media (max-width: 860px) {
  .sidebar {
    transform: translateX(-100%);
  }

  .sidebar.open {
    transform: translateX(0);
  }

  .main-content {
    margin-left: 0;
    padding: 0 18px 36px;
  }

  .mobile-only {
    display: grid;
  }

  .topbar {
    min-height: 84px;
  }

  .topbar-actions .button-secondary {
    display: none;
  }

  .filters-grid,
  .settings-grid {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }

  .settings-grid .info-panel {
    grid-column: auto;
  }

  .calendar-day {
    min-height: 95px;
  }
}

@media (max-width: 620px) {
  .topbar {
    align-items: flex-start;
    padding: 16px 0;
  }

  .topbar h2 {
    font-size: 22px;
  }

  .topbar-actions .button {
    padding: 10px 12px;
    font-size: 12px;
  }

  .hero-card {
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 18px;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .metrics-grid {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }

  .panel {
    padding: 16px;
  }

  .legend {
    display: none;
  }

  .form-grid {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }

  .full-span {
    grid-column: auto;
  }

  .calendar-day {
    min-height: 74px;
    padding: 6px;
  }

  .calendar-event {
    font-size: 0;
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    padding: 0;
    display: inline-block;
    border-radius: 50%;
  }
}

  
/* Module d'étude de faisabilité financière */
.feasibility-layout {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.25fr) minmax(320px, 0.75fr);
  gap: 18px;
}

.feasibility-form {
  display: grid;
  gap: 18px;
}

.subsection {
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  background: var(--surface-soft);
  border-radius: 15px;
  padding: 16px;
}

.subsection-header {
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 12px;
  margin-bottom: 14px;
}

.subsection-header h4,
.subsection-header p {
  margin: 0;
}

.subsection-header h4 {
  font-size: 15px;
}

.subsection-header p {
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 12px;
  margin-top: 4px;
  line-height: 1.5;
}

.dynamic-list {
  display: grid;
  gap: 10px;
}

.dynamic-row {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: minmax(150px, 1.4fr) minmax(125px, 0.7fr) minmax(130px, 0.8fr) 38px;
  gap: 9px;
  align-items: end;
}

.dynamic-row.cost-row {
  grid-template-columns: minmax(145px, 1.25fr) minmax(115px, 0.72fr) minmax(130px, 0.78fr) minmax(120px, 0.72fr) 38px;
}

.dynamic-row input,
.dynamic-row select {
  width: 100%;
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius: 10px;
  background: var(--surface);
  padding: 10px 11px;
  outline: none;
}

.dynamic-row input:focus,
.dynamic-row select:focus {
  border-color: #8db4aa;
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(29, 91, 79, 0.1);
}

.dynamic-label {
  display: grid;
  gap: 6px;
}

.dynamic-label > span {
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 10px;
  font-weight: 800;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.05em;
}

.remove-row-btn {
  width: 38px;
  height: 40px;
  border-radius: 10px;
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  background: var(--surface);
  color: var(--danger);
  font-size: 19px;
}

.add-row-btn {
  margin-top: 10px;
  border: 1px dashed #aac2bb;
  background: transparent;
  color: var(--primary);
  border-radius: 10px;
  padding: 10px 12px;
  font-weight: 800;
}

.feasibility-results {
  position: sticky;
  top: 18px;
  align-self: start;
}

.feasibility-status {
  border-radius: 16px;
  padding: 18px;
  margin-bottom: 15px;
  background: var(--surface-soft);
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
}

.feasibility-status.good {
  background: var(--success-soft);
  border-color: #cbe8d8;
}

.feasibility-status.warning {
  background: var(--warning-soft);
  border-color: #f0d9ae;
}

.feasibility-status.danger {
  background: var(--danger-soft);
  border-color: #f0caca;
}

.feasibility-status h3,
.feasibility-status p {
  margin: 0;
}

.feasibility-status h3 {
  font-size: 19px;
}

.feasibility-status p {
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 13px;
  line-height: 1.55;
  margin-top: 7px;
}

.feasibility-kpis {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
  gap: 10px;
}

.feasibility-kpi {
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius: 13px;
  padding: 13px;
  background: var(--surface);
}

.feasibility-kpi span,
.feasibility-kpi strong,
.feasibility-kpi small {
  display: block;
}

.feasibility-kpi span {
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 11px;
}

.feasibility-kpi strong {
  margin-top: 7px;
  font-size: 17px;
}

.feasibility-kpi small {
  color: var(--muted);
  margin-top: 5px;
  font-size: 10px;
  line-height: 1.4;
}

.analysis-box {
  margin-top: 14px;
  display: grid;
  gap: 10px;
}

.analysis-item {
  padding: 12px 0;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
}

.analysis-item:last-child {
  border-bottom: 0;
}

.analysis-item strong,
.analysis-item p {
  margin: 0;
}

.analysis-item strong {
  font-size: 13px;
}

.analysis-item p {
  color: var(--muted);
  margin-top: 5px;
  line-height: 1.55;
  font-size: 12px;
}

.breakdown-table {
  margin-top: 15px;
  width: 100%;
  min-width: 0;
}

.breakdown-table td,
.breakdown-table th {
  padding: 10px 6px;
  font-size: 11px;
}

.method-note {
  margin-top: 14px;
  padding: 12px;
  border-radius: 12px;
  background: #eef3f5;
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 11px;
  line-height: 1.55;
}

.inline-actions {
  display: flex;
  gap: 9px;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
}

@media (max-width: 1050px) {
  .feasibility-layout {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }

  .feasibility-results {
    position: static;
  }
}

@media (max-width: 700px) {
  .dynamic-row,
  .dynamic-row.cost-row {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    padding: 12px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: var(--surface);
  }

  .remove-row-btn {
    width: 100%;
  }

  .feasibility-kpis {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }
}


.install-app-button {
  width: 100%;
  border: 1px solid rgba(241, 213, 138, 0.35);
  background: rgba(241, 213, 138, 0.10);
  color: #f1d58a;
  padding: 12px 13px;
  border-radius: 12px;
  font-weight: 800;
  margin-bottom: 10px;
  text-align: left;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 10px;
}
.install-app-button:hover {
  background: rgba(241, 213, 138, 0.16);
}
.install-app-button[hidden] {
  display: none;
}
.offline-indicator {
  position: fixed;
  left: 50%;
  bottom: 14px;
  transform: translateX(-50%);
  z-index: 300;
  padding: 9px 13px;
  border-radius: 999px;
  background: #17212b;
  color: #fff;
  font-size: 12px;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow);
}

</style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="app-shell">
    <aside class="sidebar" id="sidebar">
      <div class="brand">
        <div class="brand-mark">OF</div>
        <div>
          <h1>Okane Flow</h1>
          <p>Cashflow planner</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <nav class="nav-list" aria-label="Navigation principale">
        <button class="nav-item active" data-view="dashboard">
          <span>◫</span> Tableau de bord
        </button>
        <button class="nav-item" data-view="transactions">
          <span>↕</span> Événements
        </button>
        <button class="nav-item" data-view="calendar">
          <span>▦</span> Calendrier
        </button>
        <button class="nav-item" data-view="feasibility">
          <span>◇</span> Faisabilité
        </button>
        <button class="nav-item" data-view="settings">
          <span>⚙</span> Paramètres
        </button>
      </nav>

      <div class="sidebar-footer">
        <button class="install-app-button" id="installAppBtn" hidden>
          <span>↓</span>
          Installer Okane Flow
        </button>
        <div class="status-chip">
          <span class="status-dot"></span>
          Données enregistrées localement
        </div>
      </div>
    </aside>

    <main class="main-content">
      <header class="topbar">
        <div class="topbar-left">
          <button class="icon-button mobile-only" id="sidebarToggle" aria-label="Ouvrir le menu">☰</button>
          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow" id="pageEyebrow">Vue générale</p>
            <h2 id="pageTitle">Tableau de bord</h2>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="topbar-actions">
          <button class="button button-secondary" id="loadDemoBtn">Charger une démo</button>
          <button class="button button-primary" id="openEventModalBtn">+ Nouvel événement</button>
        </div>
      </header>

      <section id="dashboardView" class="view active">
        <div class="hero-card">
          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">Prévision au <span id="forecastEndLabel">—</span></p>
            <h3 id="projectedBalanceHero">0 Ar</h3>
            <p id="heroStatusText">Ajoutez vos premiers événements pour commencer la simulation.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="hero-actions">
            <label class="field compact-field">
              <span>Horizon</span>
              <select id="forecastRange">
                <option value="30">30 jours</option>
                <option value="60">60 jours</option>
                <option value="90" selected>90 jours</option>
                <option value="180">180 jours</option>
                <option value="365">1 an</option>
              </select>
            </label>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="metrics-grid">
          <article class="metric-card">
            <div class="metric-icon income">↗</div>
            <div>
              <p>Solde initial</p>
              <strong id="openingBalanceMetric">0 Ar</strong>
              <small>Point de départ de la simulation</small>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="metric-card">
            <div class="metric-icon positive">＋</div>
            <div>
              <p>Encaissements prévus</p>
              <strong id="incomeMetric">0 Ar</strong>
              <small>Sur l’horizon sélectionné</small>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="metric-card">
            <div class="metric-icon negative">−</div>
            <div>
              <p>Décaissements prévus</p>
              <strong id="expenseMetric">0 Ar</strong>
              <small>Sur l’horizon sélectionné</small>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="metric-card">
            <div class="metric-icon balance">◎</div>
            <div>
              <p>Solde final prévu</p>
              <strong id="endingBalanceMetric">0 Ar</strong>
              <small id="endingBalanceHint">Projection quotidienne</small>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>

        <div class="dashboard-grid">
          <article class="panel chart-panel">
            <div class="panel-header">
              <div>
                <p class="eyebrow">Projection</p>
                <h3>Évolution du solde</h3>
              </div>
              <div class="legend">
                <span><i class="legend-line"></i> Solde journalier</span>
                <span><i class="legend-risk"></i> Zone de découvert</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="chart-wrap">
              <canvas id="cashflowChart" aria-label="Graphique de trésorerie"></canvas>
              <div id="chartEmptyState" class="empty-state">
                <div class="empty-icon">⌁</div>
                <h4>Aucune projection disponible</h4>
                <p>Ajoutez des événements pour visualiser votre trésorerie jour après jour.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="panel risk-panel">
            <div class="panel-header">
              <div>
                <p class="eyebrow">Vigilance</p>
                <h3>Risques détectés</h3>
              </div>
              <span class="risk-badge" id="riskLevelBadge">Aucun</span>
            </div>
            <div id="riskSummary" class="risk-summary">
              <div class="risk-visual safe">✓</div>
              <div>
                <strong>Aucun risque analysé</strong>
                <p>La simulation sera évaluée dès que des données seront disponibles.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div id="riskDetails" class="risk-details"></div>
          </article>
        </div>

        <div class="dashboard-grid bottom-grid">
          <article class="panel">
            <div class="panel-header">
              <div>
                <p class="eyebrow">À venir</p>
                <h3>Prochains mouvements</h3>
              </div>
              <button class="text-button" data-switch-view="transactions">Tout afficher</button>
            </div>
            <div id="upcomingEvents" class="event-list"></div>
          </article>

          <article class="panel">
            <div class="panel-header">
              <div>
                <p class="eyebrow">Répartition</p>
                <h3>Flux par catégorie</h3>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div id="categoryBreakdown" class="category-list"></div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="transactionsView" class="view">
        <div class="section-toolbar">
          <div class="filters-grid">
            <label class="field">
              <span>Rechercher</span>
              <input type="search" id="searchInput" placeholder="Libellé ou catégorie" />
            </label>
            <label class="field">
              <span>Type</span>
              <select id="typeFilter">
                <option value="all">Tous</option>
                <option value="income">Encaissements</option>
                <option value="expense">Décaissements</option>
              </select>
            </label>
            <label class="field">
              <span>Statut</span>
              <select id="statusFilter">
                <option value="all">Tous</option>
                <option value="planned">Prévu</option>
                <option value="confirmed">Confirmé</option>
                <option value="paid">Réalisé</option>
              </select>
            </label>
          </div>
        </div>

        <article class="panel">
          <div class="panel-header">
            <div>
              <p class="eyebrow">Registre</p>
              <h3>Événements financiers</h3>
            </div>
            <span class="count-badge" id="eventCountBadge">0 événement</span>
          </div>

          <div class="table-wrap">
            <table>
              <thead>
                <tr>
                  <th>Événement</th>
                  <th>Type</th>
                  <th>Date</th>
                  <th>Récurrence</th>
                  <th>Statut</th>
                  <th class="align-right">Montant</th>
                  <th></th>
                </tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody id="eventsTableBody"></tbody>
            </table>
            <div id="tableEmptyState" class="empty-state compact">
              <div class="empty-icon">＋</div>
              <h4>Aucun événement</h4>
              <p>Créez un encaissement ou un décaissement pour alimenter la prévision.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
      </section>

      <section id="calendarView" class="view">
        <article class="panel">
          <div class="panel-header calendar-header">
            <div>
              <p class="eyebrow">Vision mensuelle</p>
              <h3 id="calendarMonthLabel">Calendrier</h3>
            </div>
            <div class="calendar-controls">
              <button class="icon-button" id="prevMonthBtn" aria-label="Mois précédent">‹</button>
              <button class="button button-secondary" id="todayBtn">Aujourd’hui</button>
              <button class="icon-button" id="nextMonthBtn" aria-label="Mois suivant">›</button>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="calendar-weekdays">
            <span>Lun</span><span>Mar</span><span>Mer</span><span>Jeu</span><span>Ven</span><span>Sam</span><span>Dim</span>
          </div>
          <div id="calendarGrid" class="calendar-grid"></div>
        </article>
      </section>


      <section id="feasibilityView" class="view">
        <div class="feasibility-layout">
          <article class="panel">
            <div class="panel-header">
              <div>
                <p class="eyebrow">Décision financière</p>
                <h3>Étude de faisabilité d’un projet</h3>
              </div>
              <button class="button button-secondary" id="loadFeasibilityDemoBtn">Exemple</button>
            </div>

            <form id="feasibilityForm" class="feasibility-form">
              <div class="subsection">
                <div class="subsection-header">
                  <div>
                    <h4>1. Identification du projet</h4>
                    <p>Définissez l’objectif, la date envisagée et la nature du porteur.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="form-grid">
                  <label class="field full-span">
                    <span>Nom du projet</span>
                    <input type="text" id="projectNameInput" maxlength="90" placeholder="Ex. Ouverture d’un petit commerce" />
                  </label>
                  <label class="field">
                    <span>Profil</span>
                    <select id="projectProfileInput">
                      <option value="personal">Projet personnel / salarié</option>
                      <option value="business">Création ou développement d’entreprise</option>
                      <option value="association">Projet associatif</option>
                    </select>
                  </label>
                  <label class="field">
                    <span>Date de démarrage souhaitée</span>
                    <input type="date" id="desiredStartDateInput" />
                  </label>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="subsection">
                <div class="subsection-header">
                  <div>
                    <h4>2. Besoins à financer</h4>
                    <p>Détaillez les investissements, frais de lancement, stocks et autres dépenses nécessaires.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div id="projectCostsList" class="dynamic-list"></div>
                <button type="button" class="add-row-btn" id="addProjectCostBtn">+ Ajouter un coût</button>

                <div class="form-grid" style="margin-top:14px">
                  <label class="field">
                    <span>Besoin de trésorerie initial / BFR</span>
                    <input type="number" id="workingCapitalInput" min="0" step="1000" value="0" />
                    <small>Montant nécessaire pour couvrir le décalage entre paiements et encaissements.</small>
                  </label>
                  <label class="field">
                    <span>Marge de sécurité</span>
                    <div class="input-with-suffix">
                      <input type="number" id="contingencyRateInput" min="0" max="100" step="0.5" value="10" />
                      <span>%</span>
                    </div>
                    <small>Appliquée aux coûts détaillés, hors besoin de trésorerie initial.</small>
                  </label>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="subsection">
                <div class="subsection-header">
                  <div>
                    <h4>3. Ressources de financement</h4>
                    <p>Recensez uniquement les ressources réellement disponibles ou raisonnablement sécurisées.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div id="projectFundingList" class="dynamic-list"></div>
                <button type="button" class="add-row-btn" id="addProjectFundingBtn">+ Ajouter un financement</button>
              </div>

              <div class="subsection">
                <div class="subsection-header">
                  <div>
                    <h4>4. Capacité d’épargne mensuelle</h4>
                    <p>Particulièrement utile pour un salarié ou un porteur finançant progressivement le projet.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="form-grid">
                  <label class="field">
                    <span>Revenu mensuel disponible</span>
                    <input type="number" id="monthlyIncomeInput" min="0" step="1000" value="0" />
                  </label>
                  <label class="field">
                    <span>Dépenses mensuelles incompressibles</span>
                    <input type="number" id="monthlyExpensesInput" min="0" step="1000" value="0" />
                  </label>
                  <label class="field">
                    <span>Épargne mensuelle déjà prévue</span>
                    <input type="number" id="manualMonthlySavingsInput" min="0" step="1000" value="0" />
                    <small>Utilisée si elle est supérieure au revenu moins les dépenses.</small>
                  </label>
                  <label class="field">
                    <span>Épargne disponible aujourd’hui</span>
                    <input type="number" id="currentSavingsInput" min="0" step="1000" value="0" />
                    <small>À ne pas répéter dans la liste des financements.</small>
                  </label>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="subsection">
                <div class="subsection-header">
                  <div>
                    <h4>5. Exploitation prévisionnelle simplifiée</h4>
                    <p>Optionnel. Sert à estimer un excédent mensuel et un délai de récupération simple.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="form-grid">
                  <label class="field">
                    <span>Encaissements mensuels du projet</span>
                    <input type="number" id="projectMonthlyRevenueInput" min="0" step="1000" value="0" />
                  </label>
                  <label class="field">
                    <span>Décaissements mensuels du projet</span>
                    <input type="number" id="projectMonthlyOperatingCostsInput" min="0" step="1000" value="0" />
                  </label>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="inline-actions">
                <button class="button button-primary" type="submit">Analyser la faisabilité</button>
                <button class="button button-secondary" type="button" id="resetFeasibilityBtn">Réinitialiser</button>
              </div>
            </form>
          </article>

          <aside class="panel feasibility-results">
            <div class="panel-header">
              <div>
                <p class="eyebrow">Synthèse</p>
                <h3>Résultat de l’étude</h3>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div id="feasibilityStatus" class="feasibility-status warning">
              <h3>Étude à compléter</h3>
              <p>Renseignez les besoins et les ressources, puis lancez l’analyse.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="feasibility-kpis">
              <div class="feasibility-kpi">
                <span>Budget total requis</span>
                <strong id="totalProjectNeedResult">0 Ar</strong>
                <small>Coûts, sécurité et trésorerie initiale</small>
              </div>
              <div class="feasibility-kpi">
                <span>Ressources immédiates</span>
                <strong id="immediateResourcesResult">0 Ar</strong>
                <small>Financements saisis et épargne actuelle</small>
              </div>
              <div class="feasibility-kpi">
                <span>Besoin restant</span>
                <strong id="fundingGapResult">0 Ar</strong>
                <small>Montant encore à réunir</small>
              </div>
              <div class="feasibility-kpi">
                <span>Capacité d’épargne</span>
                <strong id="monthlySavingsResult">0 Ar</strong>
                <small>Montant mensuel mobilisable</small>
              </div>
              <div class="feasibility-kpi">
                <span>Délai estimé</span>
                <strong id="monthsToTargetResult">—</strong>
                <small id="targetDateHint">Date d’atteinte du budget</small>
              </div>
              <div class="feasibility-kpi">
                <span>Récupération simple</span>
                <strong id="paybackResult">—</strong>
                <small>Surplus mensuel, sans actualisation</small>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div id="feasibilityAnalysis" class="analysis-box"></div>

            <table class="breakdown-table">
              <thead>
                <tr>
                  <th>Nature</th>
                  <th class="align-right">Montant</th>
                </tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody id="projectCostBreakdown"></tbody>
            </table>

            <div class="method-note">
              Cette étude mesure d’abord la capacité à financer le lancement. Elle ne remplace pas un compte de résultat,
              un plan de trésorerie détaillé, une étude de marché ni une analyse juridique ou fiscale. Le délai de
              récupération affiché est un payback simple : il ne tient pas compte de la valeur temps de l’argent.
            </div>
          </aside>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="settingsView" class="view">
        <div class="settings-grid">
          <article class="panel">
            <div class="panel-header">
              <div>
                <p class="eyebrow">Simulation</p>
                <h3>Paramètres financiers</h3>
              </div>
            </div>
            <form id="settingsForm" class="form-stack">
              <label class="field">
                <span>Solde initial</span>
                <div class="input-with-suffix">
                  <input type="number" id="openingBalanceInput" step="1000" min="-999999999999" />
                  <span id="currencySuffix">Ar</span>
                </div>
              </label>
              <label class="field">
                <span>Seuil d’alerte</span>
                <div class="input-with-suffix">
                  <input type="number" id="alertThresholdInput" step="1000" min="-999999999999" />
                  <span>Ar</span>
                </div>
                <small>Une alerte est générée lorsque le solde passe sous ce montant.</small>
              </label>
              <label class="field">
                <span>Devise</span>
                <select id="currencyInput">
                  <option value="MGA">Ariary malgache (Ar)</option>
